[102.205995, "o", "On branch main\r\n"]
[102.209191, "o", "Your branch is behind 'main/main' by 1 commit, and can be fast-forwarded.\r\n  (use \"git pull\" to update your local branch)\r\n\r\nChanges not staged for commit:\r\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\r\n"]
[102.209307, "o", "  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\r\n\t\u001b[31mmodified:   scripts/install.sh\u001b[m\r\n\r\nUntracked files:\r\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\r\n\t\u001b[31mrecordings/003-installer-reworking.cast\u001b[m\r\n\r\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\r\n"]
